---@class posthog.accounts.QueryScanWarning
---@field actionable boolean Whether the person can change the query so it reads less and still answers the same question. Surfaces show the full advice and "Fix with AI" only when a finding is actionable.
---@field by_design? boolean|distilled.Null True when the query reads this much on purpose, so reading less would change the answer. Absent means no.
---@field cause? string|distilled.Null A label for what in the query text kept the read wide, such as `in_or`. Only analytics and the assistant read it, and the labels can change.
---@field evidence? string|distilled.Null The one fact the finding rests on.
---@field fix string What "Fix with AI" and the assistant are told to do.
---@field fix_location? posthog.accounts.QueryScanFixLocation|string|distilled.Null Where the change goes. Absent means the query itself.
---@field kind posthog.accounts.QueryScanFindingKind|string
---@field message string Shown to the person: what happened and what to do.

